{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27292","headline":"八风从律 · 蒋防","name":"八风从律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"制律窥元化，因声感八风。\n还从万籁起，更与五音同。\n习习芦灰上，泠泠玉管中。\n气随时物好，响彻霁天空。\n自得阴阳顺，能令惠泽通。\n愿吹寒谷里，从此达前蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}